    "name": "Fish and Chill",
    "steam_appid": 3764760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764760/extras/82f44ec32f18b8d9eff1c9aeaa18c19b.webp?t=1751448218\" width=209 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>super cozy idle fishing experience</strong> starring a grumpy old fisherman who never stops casting.<br>Whether you're working, watching videos, or procrastinating, he\u2019s quietly fishing in a <strong>transparent overlay that floats above your desktop</strong>. No stress, no noise \u2014 just fishing and chillin\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764760/extras/34db6ef7c4baacbc5eb9163d96aab740.webp?t=1751448218\" width=291 height=43 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Idle Fishing</strong> \u2013 Grandpa fishes non-stop while you relax</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Manual Selling</strong> \u2013 Cash in your catch when you feel like it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea4 <strong>Boat Decoration</strong> \u2013 Spend coins on cosmetic upgrades like flags, mugs, lifebuoys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef6 <strong>Multiple Boats</strong> \u2013 Unlock new boat shapes and styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf8f <strong>Fish Variety</strong> \u2013 From tiny sardines to rare golden beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Mystery Items</strong> \u2013 Occasionally hook strange or rare treasures \ud83d\udc40</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Every decoration is visible</strong> \u2013 Your boat becomes truly yours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764760/extras/0e64e1ec20f84e12eab465ec837f186a.webp?t=1751448218\" width=360 height=43 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf07 <strong>Day/Night cycle</strong> \u2013 the sky changes with time for immersive vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-drawn visuals</strong> with soft, cartoon style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc74 <strong>Animated fisherman</strong> with cozy charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a Calming water, clean layout, and relaxing visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Optional idle music</strong> \u2013 lo-fi, waves, birds &amp; ambient chill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9f Runs as a <strong>transparent, windowless overlay</strong> \u2013 like a living desktop sticker</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764760/extras/5a8d4cc66f77db9a055ba1cc17c59c9c.webp?t=1751448218\" width=400 height=43 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Always-on-top, doesn\u2019t interrupt your workflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Chill, passive, and zero-pressure gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b Ultra-lightweight \u2014 runs quietly in the background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd15 Play it actively or forget it's even there</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764760/extras/82f44ec32f18b8d9eff1c9aeaa18c19b.webp?t=1751448218\" width=209 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>super cozy idle fishing experience</strong> starring a grumpy old fisherman who never stops casting.<br>Whether you're working, watching videos, or procrastinating, he\u2019s quietly fishing in a <strong>transparent overlay that floats above your desktop</strong>. No stress, no noise \u2014 just fishing and chillin\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764760/extras/34db6ef7c4baacbc5eb9163d96aab740.webp?t=1751448218\" width=291 height=43 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Idle Fishing</strong> \u2013 Grandpa fishes non-stop while you relax</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Manual Selling</strong> \u2013 Cash in your catch when you feel like it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea4 <strong>Boat Decoration</strong> \u2013 Spend coins on cosmetic upgrades like flags, mugs, lifebuoys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef6 <strong>Multiple Boats</strong> \u2013 Unlock new boat shapes and styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf8f <strong>Fish Variety</strong> \u2013 From tiny sardines to rare golden beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Mystery Items</strong> \u2013 Occasionally hook strange or rare treasures \ud83d\udc40</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Every decoration is visible</strong> \u2013 Your boat becomes truly yours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_